00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:23.070
Perjalanan menuju

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:22.320
surga, ya.

00:24:21.230 --> 00:24:23.690
Apa ada orang

00:24:21.270 --> 00:24:22.650
yang pernah

00:24:21.650 --> 00:24:23.070
memuji dirimu?

00:24:22.110 --> 00:24:23.940
Aku tidak yakin

00:24:22.150 --> 00:24:24.530
aku mengerti...

00:24:22.650 --> 00:24:24.440
Tubuhmu bagus ...

00:24:22.900 --> 00:24:24.690
pak tua.

00:24:23.360 --> 00:24:25.490
Qué bien te conservas.

00:24:23.610 --> 00:24:25.490
di Kontinen Utara, Äußerst.

00:24:23.740 --> 00:24:26.740
Apa itu penyihir kelas satu?

00:24:25.240 --> 00:24:27.950
Barang antik

00:24:26.030 --> 00:24:28.200
apa itu?

00:24:26.150 --> 00:24:28.200
Itulah kami ...

00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:28.240
para Elf.

